### Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension and IntelliJ HTTP client.
@gw = http://localhost:8080

### Gateway landing page
GET {{gw}}/

### Products
GET {{gw}}/products
###
GET {{gw}}/products?category=accessories
###
POST {{gw}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Webcam", "description": "1080p", "price": 59.90, "category": "Accessories" }

### Inventory
GET {{gw}}/inventory/1
###
POST {{gw}}/inventory/1/reserve?quantity=2
###
POST {{gw}}/inventory/5/reserve?quantity=999

### Recommendations (live or fallback)
GET {{gw}}/recommendations
###
GET {{gw}}/recommendations/1

### Chaos control
POST {{gw}}/admin/recommendation/chaos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mode": "LATENCY", "latencyMs": 4000 }
###
POST {{gw}}/admin/recommendation/chaos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mode": "NONE" }

### Live resilience state
GET {{gw}}/resilience/status
